 "category_zh": "古镇村落",
 "category_en": "Ancient town",
 "intro_zh": "皖南古村落景区以西递村、宏村为代表，是安徽南部民居中较有代表性的两座古村落。西递村已有950多年的历史，村内完好地保存着典型的明清古村落风格，有“活的古民居博物馆”之称。宏村始建于公元1131年，是中国封建社会后期文化的典型代表，集中体现了工艺精湛的徽派民居特色。",
 "intro_en": "The Wannan Ancient Village Scenic Spot is represented by Xidi Village and Hongcun, which are two of the more representative ancient villages among the folk houses in southern Anhui. Xidi Village has a history of more than 950 years. The typical ancient village style of the Ming and Qing Dynasties is well preserved in the village, and it is known as the \"living ancient residential museum\". Hongcun was founded in 1131 AD. It is a typical representative of the culture of the late feudal society in China and embodies the characteristics of Huizhou folk houses with exquisite craftsmanship.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
